	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - USB HOST\n\nUSB-A receptacle on P4 USB 2.0 HS OTG (host mode). 90R diff pair, ESD (low-cap).\nVBUS from 5V_SDR via TPS25200 eFuse (limit ~2.5 A, set by resistor), EN + FAULT to P4.\nShunt for PM1 ch4 is upstream of the eFuse.\nBulk cap >=120 uF on VBUS for hub/SDR inrush.\nTarget: up to 4 RTL-SDR receivers via external hub (see risks in docs/architecture.md)."
